flowchart LR
 C[Customer acceptance contract] --> API[FastAPI admission]
 API --> D[Declared integration context]
 D --> P[Bounded scenario planner]
 P --> X[Input-only scripted target]
 O[Independent curated oracle] --> V[Observation verifier]
 X --> V
 V --> G[Witness-Coverage Gate]
 G --> S[Evidence digest]
 S --> H[Human review]
 H --> E[Local handoff capsule]
 API --> L[(SQLite ledger)]
 P -. optional .-> B[Bedrock catalog-ID proposer]
 S -. optional .-> I[LangGraph interrupt / SQLite checkpoint]
